    "name": "Deadly Shaft",
    "steam_appid": 1626150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/ff725f7bf986955ae2b27526a696fd68.avif?t=1753606067\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This product is still in a very early alpha phase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Shaft </strong>is a thrilling open-world survival horror game set in a luxurious, mysterious mansion on a remote island called \u201c<strong>Veilshore</strong>\u201d. The player Ashley, a 21-year-old gothic woman with magical abilities from \u201c<strong>Emberwick</strong>\u201d, falls into a trap and must confront the dark secrets of the mansion and its owner.<br><br><strong>Deadly Shaft</strong> has <strong>stealth-based gameplay</strong> where you have to sneak, work and hide - combined with surveillance, resource management and magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompany Ashley on an unknown adventure. Explore the mansion, sneak past dangers and hide cleverly. Solve tricky puzzles, collect important items and make smart decisions to survive and unravel the mystery of the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large, open mansion with many hidden areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time surveillance by security cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on sneaking, hiding and strategic survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CURRENT FUNCTIONS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Character starts in the mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  First-person perspective / third-person camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Carrying a canister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Day &amp; night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Sit on benches &amp; survey the landscape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide in cupboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside of working hours, the landlord can stalk you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous security cameras in the yard &amp; backyard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Loyalty of the homeowner </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPECIAL FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items and complete missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d9874f3b4f8ce801b513ed4b6b6e8f59.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d9874f3b4f8ce801b513ed4b6b6e8f59.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d9874f3b4f8ce801b513ed4b6b6e8f59.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SET YOURSELF ON BENCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the beautiful view and treat yourself to a break from work to recharge your batteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/67aa56ae77c25d7e52cc5877364b63c2.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/67aa56ae77c25d7e52cc5877364b63c2.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/67aa56ae77c25d7e52cc5877364b63c2.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FLY AND HIDE FROM THE HOUSEHOLDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide in different areas without being noticed, otherwise you will be hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/28984782272aaf31c70d88844a3ac683.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/28984782272aaf31c70d88844a3ac683.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/28984782272aaf31c70d88844a3ac683.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAMERA SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are surrounded by numerous cameras in the luxurious villa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d686efe3d734ec639778fbab9995d990.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d686efe3d734ec639778fbab9995d990.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d686efe3d734ec639778fbab9995d990.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DAY &amp; NIGHT CYCLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go to sleep and recharge your batteries by switching between day and night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/f6a2b86a240c88c67fb3f5eabaae95ed.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/f6a2b86a240c88c67fb3f5eabaae95ed.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/f6a2b86a240c88c67fb3f5eabaae95ed.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLANNED FUNCTIONS - [COMING SOON]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Fulfill mission objectives and duties of the landlord </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hostile mansion environment with security guards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More hiding and interactive environment options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locked areas with door code system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Inventory system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill tree or magic abilities (talents &amp; skill attributes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open world (island)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Escape from the mansion (story) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK MAGICAL ABILITIES [COMING SOON]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you work for the landlord, the more experience points you gain and the more new talents you unlock in the talent tree. Only when you discover the secret of the villa will your magical powers awaken.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/ff725f7bf986955ae2b27526a696fd68.avif?t=1753606067\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This product is still in a very early alpha phase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Shaft </strong>is a thrilling open-world survival horror game set in a luxurious, mysterious mansion on a remote island called \u201c<strong>Veilshore</strong>\u201d. The player Ashley, a 21-year-old gothic woman with magical abilities from \u201c<strong>Emberwick</strong>\u201d, falls into a trap and must confront the dark secrets of the mansion and its owner.<br><br><strong>Deadly Shaft</strong> has <strong>stealth-based gameplay</strong> where you have to sneak, work and hide - combined with surveillance, resource management and magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompany Ashley on an unknown adventure. Explore the mansion, sneak past dangers and hide cleverly. Solve tricky puzzles, collect important items and make smart decisions to survive and unravel the mystery of the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large, open mansion with many hidden areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time surveillance by security cameras</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on sneaking, hiding and strategic survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CURRENT FUNCTIONS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Character starts in the mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  First-person perspective / third-person camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Carrying a canister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Day &amp; night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"