R</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide in different areas without being noticed, otherwise you will be hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/28984782272aaf31c70d88844a3ac683.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/28984782272aaf31c70d88844a3ac683.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/28984782272aaf31c70d88844a3ac683.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAMERA SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are surrounded by numerous cameras in the luxurious villa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d686efe3d734ec639778fbab9995d990.poster.avif?t=1753606067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d686efe3d734ec639778fbab9995d990.webm?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/d686efe3d734ec639778fbab9995d990.mp4?t=1753606067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DAY &amp; NIGHT CYCLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go to sleep and recharge your batteries by switching between day and night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626150/extras/f6a2b86a240c88c67fb3